WEBVTT

00:00:00.220 --> 00:00:02.856
You pay for Facebook ads that run twenty-four seven.

00:00:03.077 --> 00:00:04.282
Your front desk doesn't.

00:00:04.686 --> 00:00:09.016
Reply an hour late, and a lead is seven times less likely to
talk to you.

00:00:10.136 --> 00:00:16.352
Meet your digital front desk. It answers your Facebook
Messenger, Instagram, WhatsApp or website messages.

00:00:16.572 --> 00:00:22.731
It replies using your clinic's own info, in English or a mix of
Filipino and English, then books the patient.

00:00:23.013 --> 00:00:25.127
It never guesses or diagnoses.

00:00:25.247 --> 00:00:27.861
Emergencies and tricky questions go to your staff.

